@baseUrl = http://localhost:5078

### Create a conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "customerEmail": "a.nguyen@example.com",
  "subject": "Ho tro tai khoan"
}

### List all conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations

### List waiting conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations?status=Waiting

### Get a conversation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get a missing conversation
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
